function productizationForm(s){const today=new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-CA'),types=[['performance','성능'],['body','판금'],['dent','덴트'],['polish','광택'],['car-center','카센터(기타)']],warningIcons=(s.alerts||[]).map(id=>STATUS.find(status=>status.id===id)).filter(Boolean);return`<form id="productization-form"><p class="move-car ${warningIcons.length?'has-warning-icons':''}"><b>${esc(s.plate)}</b><span>${esc(s.model)} · ${esc(normalizeVehicleColor(s.color))}</span>${warningIcons.length?`<span class="productization-warning-icons" aria-label="${esc(warningIcons.map(status=>status.label).join(', '))}">${warningIcons.map(status=>`<img src="/${esc(status.icon.normalize('NFD'))}" alt="${esc(status.label)}">`).join('')}</span>`:''}</p><fieldset><legend>작업 선택</legend><div class="productization-tabs">${types.map(([value,label])=>`<label><input type="radio" name="serviceType" value="${value}" ${value===state.productizationType?'checked':''}><span>${label}</span></label>`).join('')}</div></fieldset><label><span class="field-title">날짜</span><input type="date" name="serviceDate" value="${today}" required></label><div class="productization-detail form-row" data-service-detail="body" hidden><label><span class="field-title">수리한 외판 개수</span><input type="number" name="exteriorCount" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="개수 입력" disabled></label><label><span class="field-title">수리내용</span><input name="bodyNote" maxlength="500" placeholder="외판부위" disabled></label></div><div class="productization-detail form-row" data-service-detail="dent" hidden><label><span class="field-title">수리내용</span><input name="dentNote" maxlength="500" placeholder="덴트 작업 내용" disabled></label><label><span class="field-title">비용</span><input name="dentCost" maxlength="100" placeholder="예: 100,000원" disabled></label></div><fieldset class="productization-detail" data-service-detail="polish" hidden><legend>광택업체명</legend><div class="polish-vendors"><label><input type="radio" name="polishType" value="스타" required disabled><span>스타</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="polishType" value="신화" required disabled><span>신화</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="productization-detail form-row" data-service-detail="car-center" hidden><label><span class="field-title">수리내용</span><input name="carCenterNote" maxlength="500" placeholder="작업 내용" disabled></label><label><span class="field-title">수리업체명</span><input name="carCenterVendor" maxlength="100" placeholder="예: 신평카" disabled></label></div><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="ghost danger" data-unassign>삭제</button><button class="primary" ${state.saving?'disabled':''}>상품화출차</button></div></form>`;}
